[01:16.50]All those who hold their torches in the dark
[01:19.71]All those who look forward to spring in the cold wind
[01:26.49]All those who marched unyieldingly through the mud
[01:32.73]All who lift up the weak in their time of grief
[01:33.63]All who slaughter the light in the shadows
[02:08.10]All those who put out their fire in winter
[02:10.95]All who trample justice in their misery
[02:24.24]All those who are now dehumanized
[02:25.11]All who stare into the abyss
[02:25.71]All independent and proud people
[02:27.45]All who are ignorant
[02:28.02]All who are benumbed
[02:28.41]All of them
[03:31.32]All of them
